    {
      "text": "Ye are the salt of the earth, Matt. 5:13 (3 Ne. 12:13). Ye are the light of the world, Matt. 5:14. Be ye therefore perfect, Matt. 5:48 (3 Ne. 12:48). seek ye first the kingdom of God, Matt. 6:33 (3 Ne. 13:33). Go ye therefore, and teach all nations, baptizing, Matt. 28:19. repentance … should be preached in his name among all nations, Luke 24:47. go and bring forth fruit, John 15:16. Ye are the children … of the covenant which God made with our fathers, Acts 3:25 (3 Ne. 20:25). called to be saints, 1 Cor. 1:2. we … as Isaac was, are the children of promise, Gal. 4:28. put on the new man, Eph. 4:24. perverse nation, among whom ye shine as lights, Philip. 2:15. royal priesthood, an holy nation, a peculiar people, 1 Pet. 2:9.",
